04800-3' class='ms fillblank-option-20' index='3' name='fbo-904800-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-904800-3' /></span></strong>&nbsp;and traditional skills, which serve as a vital link to our <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>20.5</label><input id='fbo-904800-4' class='ms fillblank-option-20' index='4' name='fbo-904800-4' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-904800-4' /></span></strong>.</p>",
